# Vault access

Operator/agent CLI: `VAULT_ADDR=https://vault.adryan.me` and token from Secret `vault-policy-token` in namespace `vault`.

- Do **not** `kubectl port-forward` to Vault for routine `vault kv` work — the public mesh host is the supported path.
- Full notes: `docs/agents/vault.md`.
